--- !u!114 &918353418
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 918353417}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 627c1c2bfea08a54997d89f353dc3858, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  setEvents:
    events:
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 918353417}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 7096670327494543431, guid: 1189e97e912249f40a9ba9cf596f1aea, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: Now you need to collect scroll before taking the quiz
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 100815450}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 775726565}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 501167914}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions:
        - player: 0
          character: {fileID: 918353417}
          emotes: 0
          duration: 0
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 2
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 918353417}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: "Magandang pagbabalik, Bayani!\r                                                              
            Sa ikalawang bahagi ng El Filibusterismo, mas lumalalim ang mga sugat
            ng lipunan\u2014ang kawalan ng hustisya, pang-aabuso ng kapangyarihan,
            at pagkakait ng karapatan sa mahihirap.\r\n"
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins: []
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 0
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 918353417}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: Good day, class!
        - characterObj: {fileID: 918353417}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 0}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: "Today, we are going to talk about a very interesting and important
            topic \u2014 the thematic analysis of Chapters 1 to 5 of Noli Me Tangere.
            This lesson is important because it helps us understand not only the
            story, but also the social issues and historical realities that Rizal
            wanted to expose during his time"
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 100815450}
          direction: 1
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 775726565}
          direction: 1
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 501167914}
          direction: 1
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 501167914}
          direction: 2
          walk: 0
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 1
      interval: 1
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 918353417}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 7096670327494543431, guid: 1189e97e912249f40a9ba9cf596f1aea, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: Sa mga kabanatang ito, ipinakita ni Rizal ang hindi patas na lipunan
            kung saan ang batas ay para lamang sa mayayaman at makapangyarihan, habang
            ang mga maralita ay patuloy na pinagsasamantalahan.
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 100815450}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 775726565}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 501167914}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 0
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 918353417}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 4146786208365501868, guid: 4d1a23ce7c18ee24a90e479041cc0e0c, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: "Si Kabesang Tales ay biktima ng sistemang mapang-api. Ang lupa niyang
            pinaghirapan ay sapilitang kinuha ng mga prayle. Ipinakita ni Rizal dito
            ang kawalang-hustisya sa lipunan\u2014kung paanong ang may kapangyarihan
            ay umaapak sa karapatan ng mahihirap. Ang kanyang kwento ay salamin ng
            kalagayan ng mga magsasakang pinagkaitan ng lupa, dangal, at tinig."
        - characterObj: {fileID: 918353417}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 1335385452945238478, guid: 8df4d04f9e8f846498a5de01c11f114a, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: "Si Basilio ay sagisag ng kabataang naniniwala na sa edukasyon matatagpuan
            ang kalayaan.\r                                                                                                                                                                                 
            Bagama\u2019t dumanas ng hirap, patuloy siyang nagsikap upang itaguyod
            ang karunungan at katotohanan.\r\nIpinakita ni Rizal na ang kabataan,
            sa kabila ng kahirapan, ay may kakayahang baguhin ang lipunan.\r\n"
        - characterObj: {fileID: 918353417}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 4633355498211079068, guid: 93a8fc0e8afee0b45b73dd44177227f1, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 1
          line: Habang pinagmamasdan ni Simoun ang mga tiwaling opisyal, lalo niyang
            napatunayan na ang hustisya ay laruan ng makapangyarihan. Ginamit ni
            Rizal ang eksenang ito upang ipakita na ang kalaban ay hindi isang tao,
            kundi ang mismong sistemang nagpapayaman sa mga ganid.
      setLocation:
        setLocatoins:
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 100815450}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 775726565}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
        - player: 1
          character: {fileID: 0}
          tartgetLocation: {fileID: 501167914}
          direction: 0
          walk: 1
          camFollow: 0
          cooldown: 0
      setEmotes:
        emotions: []
      questions:
        fromDatabase: 0
        questions:
          questions: []
        cycle: 1
        isOneTime: 0
        DeductTime: 0
      eventType: 0
      interval: 0
    - dialogue:
        dialogueLines:
        - characterObj: {fileID: 918353417}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 7096670327494543431, guid: 1189e97e912249f40a9ba9cf596f1aea, type: 3}
          dialogueType: 0
          line: At dito na nagtatapos ang ating talakayan
        - characterObj: {fileID: 918353417}
          player: 0
          cameraFollow: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 7096670327494543431, guid: 1189e97e912249f40a9ba9cf596f1aea, type: 3}
